<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span>​</span>​</span></span><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/869f65_2d36b4a6457d4461aeab4f97c44f3e2d~mv2.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</a></span><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/869f65_83023d1cc463492f9ec44a5cf05fda50~mv2.png" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></a></span><a href="https://869f65fb-a081-4c74-84c0-a6778a105314.usrfiles.com/ugd/869f65_8c70548754814f74aa989c1fa61554ec.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></a><a href="https://www.baymills.org/_files/ugd/869f65_78c23fcbd6f543b8bb202fe0d08d31f1.pdf" target="_blank" class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</a>​​​​​<a href="https://www.baymills.org/_files/ugd/869f65_509c48ec023d4d7aa8c47ab6f3ca42fd.pdf" target="_blank" class="wixui-rich-text__text">​​​</a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=10159971373963837&set=gm.2503757306470338&idorvanity=804009906445095" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</a>​​​​​​​<a href="https://www.baymills.org/_files/ugd/869f65_57c8cfeb15524a29b291282bf5408eb7.pdf" target="_blank" class="wixui-rich-text__text">​​</a><a href="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/869f65_657fef8efd2546d0bf8b847f870245a0~mv2.png" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text">​​​</a>​​​​​​​​​​​​<a href="https://www.baymills.org/_files/ugd/869f65_91bec57103104fa7a7959fa6f246aa52.pdf" target="_blank" class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</a><a href="https://www.baymills.org/_files/ugd/869f65_12fb1dbe0e734284a2bca62def102e46.pdf" target="_blank" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></a><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span><span class="color_41 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span>​</span></span></span><a href="https://www.baymills.org/_files/ugd/869f65_12fb1dbe0e734284a2bca62def102e46.pdf" target="_blank" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">​<span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></a><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span><a href="https://www.baymills.org/_files/ugd/869f65_a199c0ff22b04691ab1dc6fe9cd4aad5.pdf" target="_blank" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></a>​<span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span><span class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span>​</span></p>

<ul class="font_5 font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="color:rgb(50, 50, 50); font-size:20px;">
<li style="line-height:1.4em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<h5 class="font_5 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:1.4em; font-size:20px;">Bay Mills Community College has applied for USDA Community Facilities grant funding.&nbsp; The funds will be used for furnishings for the new Allied Health Facility.&nbsp; Any comments can be directed to Kathy Adair at <a data-auto-recognition="true" href="mailto:kadair@bmcc.edu" class="wixui-rich-text__text">kadair@bmcc.edu</a> by August 24, 2026.</h5>
</li>
</ul>

<h5 class="font_5 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:1.4em; font-size:20px;"><span class="wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></h5>

<ul class="font_5 font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="color:rgb(50, 50, 50); font-size:20px;">
<li style="line-height:1.4em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<h5 class="font_5 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:1.4em; font-size:20px;"><span style="color:#323232;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.baymills.org/_files/ugd/869f65_4627980636194692a5a97e2ad7a5f86a.pdf" target="_blank" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Bay Mills Consumer Confidence Water Report for 2026</a></span></span></h5>
</li>
</ul>

<h5 class="font_5 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:1.4em; font-size:20px;"><span style="color:#323232;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></h5>

